do Identify the requested Inux command without inspecting the project or tools.
    Accept /inux commands and equivalent plain language. Return help, setup,
    task, branch_create, commit_changes, estimate, ts, or pr; technical summary
    is an alias for ts. Leave the full request unchanged for the selected
    workflow, including missing or conflicting action requests. Return null
    when the command itself is unsupported, conflicting, or ambiguous. as @command

if @command == "help"
    use help.flow
    return

if @command == "setup"
    use setup/setup.flow
    return

if @command == "task"
    use task.flow
    return

if @command == "branch_create"
    use branch/branch.flow
    return

if @command == "commit_changes"
    use commit/commit.flow
    return

if @command == "estimate"
    use estimate/estimate.flow
    return

if @command == "ts"
    use ts/ts.flow
    return

if @command == "pr"
    use pr/pr.flow
    return

return "Usage: /inux help, setup, task <id>, branch create, commit changes, estimate [request], ts [request], technical summary [request], or pr [request]."
